<title>USA: Cleveland repriced, top yield cut to 5.838 pct.</title>
<headline>Cleveland repriced, top yield cut to 5.838 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc said Thursday it repriced Cleveland, Ohio's $81.7 million parking bond issue, adjusting yields in several maturities and cutting the top yield in 2022 to approximately 5.838 percent from 5.85 percent.</p>
